text = "The following art assets come from asset packs. Click on an asset to view the asset pack it came from.

[url=https://beowulf.itch.io/free-dungeon-explorer-16x16]Player Sprite[/url]
[url=https://adrian8w.itch.io/top-down-tileset]Soft Wall Tileset[/url] [url=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.en](License)[/url]
Wall Tileset was CC0 but is sadly no longer available.
[url=https://xvideosman.itch.io/cave-tileset]Dirt, BG, Bonus Coin, and Mystery[/url] by Fedor Kochikov
[url=https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Press+Start+2P?query=Press+Start+2]Font[/url]
[url=https://alexkovacsart.itch.io/free-pixel-art-foods]Cherry[/url] [url=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.en](License)[/url]
[url=https://absconditusartem.itch.io/ammunition]Ammo[/url] by Absconditus.Artem
[url=https://keifoopx.itch.io/99fruitsandnuts]Apple[/url]
[url=https://quillgrafit.itch.io/pixel-art-8x-gems]Diamond[/url]
[url=https://xenophero.itch.io/rock-sprites]Rock[/url]
[url=https://merchant-shade.itch.io/16x16-mixed-rpg-icons]Bomb[/url]
[url=https://crumpaloo.itch.io/gagw]Cluster Bomb[/url]
[url=https://opengameart.org/content/gauntness]Doors[/url]
[url=https://nakinogasai.itch.io/10-free-gems]Lives[/url] by Nakino Gasai

Some of the assets were modified to better fit the game.
Grävning is not endorsed by, or affiliated with the authors of any of these assets.

The follwing software was used to make Grävning Godot:

Game Engine - [url=https://godotengine.org/]Godot[/url]
Pixel Art Editor - [url=https://libresprite.github.io/#!/]LibreSprite[/url]
Vector Art Editor - [url=https://inkscape.org/]Inkscape[/url]
Music Maker - [url=https://www.beepbox.co/]Beepbox[/url]

Grävning is not endorsed by or affiliated with the creators or maintainers of any of these software.

[url=back]Back[/url]"
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false
shortcut_keys_enabled = false
horizontal_alignment = 1

